## Summary

Document and test the end-to-end PR-cleanup loop (PR Steward to Action Bridge to Copilot repair packet to independent embedded audit to re-intake) with an offline, deterministic fixture PR. No live GitHub.

## Scope

Allowlist-bound; see commit.allowlist. Out of scope: Do not make live GitHub calls. Do not perform any mutation. Do not reuse an audit proof across differing head SHAs.

## Validation

See commit.verify; embedded audit + proof bundle required.

